    <string name="ai_web_intro">ASK looks up current information (news, prices, weather, schedules) when needed.</string>
    <string name="ai_web_anthropic">official Claude profiles search with Anthropic web search, billed to the Claude account ($10 per 1,000 searches); other profiles don\'t search.</string>
